Z||000017||theogre||01-21-2000||08:20 PM||||Raydar,<P>Originally when I heard about this problem I figured something with mounts. I hadn't seen the problem myself at that point, mine's an automatic so it's not as prone to gross examples of the problem. <P>However awhile back I test drove an 84 stick. It to had recently been aligned. The alignment was fine. (even the owner didn't know what was really happening.....) This car was all over the road. every time I punched it it went one way, when I let out it went the other.||||reg||1
